{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:14:12+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ThinkExplosive", "steam_appid": 2540550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ThinkExplosive is a small first-person puzzle-platformer about bombs! Throw bombs to overcome obstacles - or launch yourself to new heights. Explore the corridors of an abandoned facility and discover new game mechanics.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ThinkExplosive! In this first-person puzzle-platformer, you'll discover the skill of bomb-throwing as your primary tool to move through a series of different puzzles and parkour sections. Bomb your way through obstacles... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or send yourself soaring into the air with a well-placed explosion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's all about mastering the art of &quot;controlled chaos&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTREME MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign was too easy for you? If you're looking for a real challenge, there’s Extreme Mode, which you unlock after completing the main campaign. I am sure - this mode will push your skills to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world gone mad... The failed experiement has turned everything into a wasteland. But fear not, you've got Ethan to guide you through this post-apocalyptic puzzle game. As the player, you find yourself trapped in a abandoned facility filled with puzzles and parkour challenges. Your goal? Get out...! The facility is waiting for you... or what's left of it, that is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the end of the day, this game is about having fun. So get ready to blow things up, defy gravity, and take on the bombastic experience in ThinkExplosive! It's a blast, quite literally! :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Main Levels: Navigate through 10 unique levels, each presenting its own set of puzzles and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Extreme Mode Levels: Unlock the Extreme Mode and take on the 10 levels in a new way, designed to push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Hidden Golden Bombs: They are collectables - Find them all! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Different Bomb Types: Unlock two bomb types, each with its own properties and strategic advantages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Timer: Compete against other players with an integrated timer and online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Gameplay: Dynamic physics, adding more fun to your bomb-throwing maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looore: Engage with the character Ethan, who talks to you through a walkie-talkie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: Play levels created by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Level Editor: Build your own levels and publish them to the Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels and publish them to the Steam Workshop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ThinkExplosive is a small first-person puzzle-platformer about bombs! Throw bombs to overcome obstacles - or launch yourself to new heights. Explore the corridors of an abandoned facility and discover new game mechanics.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ThinkExplosive! In this first-person puzzle-platformer, you'll discover the skill of bomb-throwing as your primary tool to move through a series of different puzzles and parkour sections. Bomb your way through obstacles... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/4448dfd9a1d53666066ab009dc21b624.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...or send yourself soaring into the air with a well-placed explosion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/1c1d8e3ffd498f73c097a99bbe34c7c4.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's all about mastering the art of &quot;controlled chaos&quot;. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/8ce32ba91b8e42a396671c03afefd198.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTREME MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main campaign was too easy for you? If you're looking for a real challenge, there’s Extreme Mode, which you unlock after completing the main campaign. I am sure - this mode will push your skills to the limit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/58053c19294e8d7474ec6d16963bbffd.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world gone mad... The failed experiement has turned everything into a wasteland. But fear not, you've got Ethan to guide you through this post-apocalyptic puzzle game. As the player, you find yourself trapped in a abandoned facility filled with puzzles and parkour challenges. Your goal? Get out...! The facility is waiting for you... or what's left of it, that is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the end of the day, this game is about having fun. So get ready to blow things up, defy gravity, and take on the bombastic experience in ThinkExplosive! It's a blast, quite literally! :)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Main Levels: Navigate through 10 unique levels, each presenting its own set of puzzles and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Extreme Mode Levels: Unlock the Extreme Mode and take on the 10 levels in a new way, designed to push your skills to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Hidden Golden Bombs: They are collectables - Find them all! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Different Bomb Types: Unlock two bomb types, each with its own properties and strategic advantages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Timer: Compete against other players with an integrated timer and online leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-Based Gameplay: Dynamic physics, adding more fun to your bomb-throwing maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looore: Engage with the character Ethan, who talks to you through a walkie-talkie</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Workshop: Play levels created by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in Level Editor: Build your own levels and publish them to the Steam Workshop</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEVEL EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own levels and publish them to the Steam Workshop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.poster.avif?t=1781209365\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.webm?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2540550/extras/941357998303d2788946081f20809ce1.mp4?t=1781209365\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "ThinkExplosive is a small first-person puzzle-platformer about bombs! Throw bombs to overcome obstacles - or launch yourself to new heights. Explore the corridors of an abandoned facility and discover new game mechanics.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>l